             sentence — but the sentence has to be the TRUE one, and there is a
             way to ask again in both. */
          return lead +
            (RP_LAST_ERR
              ? note('<b>Your adapter did not answer</b> when this screen asked which '+
                     'PlayStation accounts it holds (“'+esc(RP_LAST_ERR)+'”). That is not the '+
                     'same as it being unable to add one — it may simply not have answered this '+
                     'time.','warn')
              : note('<b>Your adapter’s software cannot add accounts yet.</b> The part that links a '+
                     'PlayStation account is still being built, so there is nothing on this screen '+
                     'that could reach it.','warn'))+
            btn('Check again', null, 'psn-recheck')+
            sh('What to do instead')+
            note('Use the <b>ZeroStick dashboard on a PC</b>; its PlayStation panel does the same job.')+
            helpHTML('psn-instead', 'What to do instead', 'Use the <b>ZeroStick dashboard on a PC</b> — its PlayStation panel runs the '+
