           reply — a claim about the BOARD made from something that is only a
           claim itself, and it sat two lines above a read-back saying the
           board's list held no such account. Whether the adapter knows an
           account is now the receipt card's question and only its question;
           this row names which account the steps below are for. */
        h += card('<div class="stat"><span>These steps are for</span><b'+(st.acct?' class="ok"':'')+'>'+
